      "widgets_values": [
        "**New wildcard entries from an LLM.** Generate Text writes a numbered list, **AB Text Lines** strips the numbers (replace, regex `^\\d+[.:)]\\s*` → nothing), **AB Wildcard Save** adds the lines that `llm/professions` doesn't have yet. Use it in a prompt as `__llm/professions__`.\n\nRun it again with another seed for more entries. Read the list before you rely on it: a small model repeats itself and drifts."
